Usage: millstream inbox <command> [<args>] [flags]

List and decide reviews and review samples.

Commands:
  list                           List the open reviews (the default).
  show <delivery>                Show a review: its item, its display and what may be edited.
  approve <delivery>             Approve a review, optionally editing the item first.
  reject <delivery>              Reject a review, with a reason code when the step lists some.
  samples                        List the open review samples.
  sample <delivery> <decision>   Decide a review sample: agree or disagree with the rule that
                                 approved it.

Run "millstream inbox <command> --help" for a command's arguments and flags.
